type: software
title: "SUMO-demand2traffic"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible workflow for transforming synthetic population and
  activity-chain data generated with Eqasim and MATSim into a multimodal
  microscopic SUMO scenario for traffic and individual emission assessment.
